# The 33 photographs and the 27 page images are served from the benchmark's asset dataset at the commit that
# ../assets.sha256 pins: the image fetches them while it builds and setup.sh stages them into the agent home. Local
# copies here (the task's generators write them) stay out of git.
payload/photos/*.jpg
payload/catalogue/datasheets/*.png
payload/catalogue/errata/*.png
payload/catalogue/lot_reports/*.png
